      "page": 385,
      "ruku": 334,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3256,
      "text": "Indeed, Pharaoh arrogantly elevated himself in the land and divided its people into different factions; oppressing one group of them[2], slaughtering their sons and sparing their women alive[3]. He was truly one of those who spread corruption.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
